  "note": "As the book's proof of 4.2.2 says, for odd n C doubles and A halves, which gives c₁ = 1 + |η'|₁/(x/D). Sum_A1's cruder A = x/2 + |η'|₁/2 is harmless there, because only Lemma 4.1.2's first bound, which does not involve A, is used."
